<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Fila cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Fila cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs said it downgraded Fila Holdings SpA to market outperform from its priority and recommended lists.</p>
<p>-- shares fell 6-1/8 to 59-3/4.</p>
